    "Initial native verification selected a stale Skia cache and its source identity check rejected it; matching fixed component inputs were selected without bypassing validation.",
    "A crash recovery fixture still declared old worker wire version 1; it was migrated explicitly to version 2 and old version rejection was added as a separate test.",
    "Initial independent consumer compiled and ran with an unused-import warning; final packaged consumer passed strict Clippy and real export after the import was removed."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "All reported worker/SDK executions are macOS arm64 development builds; no release-size or throughput benefit is asserted.",
    "This turn did not change Musterwork sources or migrate any application database; its pending v188 work is not verified here.",
    "Legacy MCP/standard host still require migration out of the normal Agent delivery path. MCP client protocol probes were not selected in this gate run.",
    "Standalone SDK currently exposes existing create/import/edit/export computation; complete high-level playback, advanced content, Office/WPS and I01-I20 remain open.",
    "Output claims retain only structure passed; layout, native-editability, playback and target-application remain not_proven for the full delivery profile."
